meta {
  name: One listing
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/products/1
}

docs {
  Every card carries **two independent badges**: `condition` (what the part is)
  and `inspection` (whether MonaFind looked at it). A brand-new part can be
  uninspected and a car-breaker part can be inspected — never render one
  without the other.

  Run this **without** a token to see the guest view: the seller's contact
  fields come back with their labels and their values blurred.
}
